msgstr "The idea, in four pieces"

msgid "Not by coercion,"
msgstr "Not by coercion,"

msgid "but by attraction."
msgstr "but by attraction."

msgid "Those who participate gain perspective and prosperity. Those who stay out feel pressure from below. The same mechanism that pulled Eastern Europe out of dictatorships, but applied worldwide."
msgstr "Those who participate gain perspective and prosperity. Those who stay out feel pressure from below. The same mechanism that pulled Eastern Europe out of dictatorships, but applied worldwide."

msgid "Act on behaviour"
msgstr "Act on behaviour"

msgid "A single tariff system per country, based on values we share: for freedom, anti-corruption, the international rule of law, human rights and sustainability. Full compliance? 0% import duties. Commit aggression? Excluded."
msgstr "A single tariff system per country, based on values we share: for freedom, anti-corruption, the international rule of law, human rights and sustainability. Full compliance? 0% import duties. Commit aggression? Excluded."

msgid "Peaceful, but not naive"
msgstr "A peaceful geopolitical power"

msgid "No war, but strategic independence. The GU invests heavily in raw materials, energy, defence and its own AI capabilities. If regimes misbehave, we support the opposition."
msgstr "No war, but strategic independence. The GU invests heavily in raw materials, energy, defence and its own AI capabilities. If regimes misbehave, we support the opposition."

msgid "Free information"
msgstr "Free information"

msgid "Independent journalism in local languages, following the BBC model. Protected technology that frees people from state-controlled internet. Freedom begins with knowledge."
msgstr "Independent journalism in local languages, following the BBC model. Protected technology that frees people from state-controlled internet. Freedom begins with knowledge."

msgid "A single trade zone, limited free movement of people"
msgstr "A single trade zone, limited free movement of people"

msgid "Common tariffs, yes. Full free movement of people, no. For scarce talent, temporary visas for high-value work apply. The GU invests in remote training programmes and internships to develop talent, and facilitates remote working. Experience and knowledge flow back to the home country."
msgstr "For high-value work, we issue temporary work visas to scarce talent from GU countries as well as non-GU countries. The GU invests in training programmes to develop talent, so that knowledge and experience flow back to the home country."

msgid "The European Union is a great success. Many countries with authoritarian regimes joined its ranks. Their people wanted to belong to the EU. For prosperity. For freedom."
msgstr "The European Union is a great success. Many countries with authoritarian regimes joined its ranks. Their people wanted to belong to the EU. For prosperity. For freedom."

msgid "The EU is not finished. There is much to improve. But that need not hold us back. We can already expand the cooperation beyond Europe, with functioning democracies, such as Canada, Japan and Australia. And with candidate countries that already have a reasonably strong democracy, such as Malaysia, Chile, Costa Rica, Botswana and Ghana. The Global Union exists alongside the EU and the UN. The goal is an ever-growing community of functioning democracies."
msgstr "The EU is not finished. There is much to improve. But that need not hold us back. We can already expand the cooperation beyond Europe, with functioning democracies, such as Canada, Japan and Australia. And with candidate countries that already have a reasonably strong democracy, such as Malaysia, Chile, Costa Rica, Botswana and Ghana. The Global Union exists alongside the EU and the UN. The goal is an ever-growing community of functioning democracies."

msgid "Global Union Forum is a think tank. We investigate whether this model can work worldwide: a cooperation of countries that take democracy, the rule of law, sustainability and human rights seriously."
msgstr "Global Union Forum is a think tank. We investigate whether this model can work worldwide: a cooperation of countries that take democracy, the rule of law, sustainability and human rights seriously."

msgid "A first manifesto has been drawn up. We want to improve the idea with the intelligence of everyone willing to think it through. All input will be collected and processed to arrive at a new manifesto."
msgstr "A first manifesto has been drawn up. We want to improve the idea with the intelligence of everyone willing to think it through. All input will be collected and processed to arrive at a new manifesto."

