msgid "No membership. No fees. Just an online space where the thinking happens. The first site has now been set up by <a href=\"%(value)s\" style=\"color: var(--gu-globe); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;\">Gerhard Top</a>. The next step is gathering feedback from a handful of beta users and involving a few co-initiators, both experts and other enthusiasts. After that we'll build on the discussion with an improved version, invite many more people to join, and set up a foundation with the goal of growing into a movement that makes the Global Union happen, and succeed."
msgstr "No membership. No fees. Just an online space where the thinking happens. The first site has now been set up by <a href=\"%(value)s\" style=\"color: var(--gu-globe); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;\">Gerhard Top</a>. The next step is gathering feedback from a handful of beta users and involving a few co-initiators, both experts and other enthusiasts. After that we'll build on the discussion with an improved version, invite many more people to join, and set up a foundation with the goal of growing into a movement that makes the Global Union happen, and succeed."

